# The checks, for the core and the Atlas provider alike (tests, lint, types, audit, licenses,
# build, the locks and the Dependabot file): the tools the checks run, by name, each locked with
# its hashes in dev.txt, the only place their versions live (the dev extra of pyproject.toml names
# them without a version), at the versions of the image and of the release wherever they install
# the same package. Compiled on the Python of the image, installed
# on each Python of the checks with build.txt (scripts/lock.sh), as pip and setuptools are left
# out of this lock.
# The -r lines order the compilation of the locks (image.in and release.in first), the -c lines
# keep their versions.
-r image.in
-r release.in
-c image.txt
-c release.txt
-e file:.[dev]
check-jsonschema
mypy
pip-audit
pip-licenses
pip-tools
pytest
pytest-cov
ruff
uv
